"{\"len\":9009,\"text\":\"CTRL + K\\n\\nHome\\n\\nCommunity\\n\\nStartups\\n\\nMentors\\n\\nMarketplace\\n\\nBusiness Setup\\n\\nEvents\\n\\nIgnyte Challenges\\n\\nUpgrade\\n\\nMuhammad Yaseen\\n\\nUser Profile\\nMy User Profile\\n\\nmy5757980@gmail.com\\n\\nMy Events\\nMy Requests\\nSaved list\\nNotifications\\nBillings and Plans\\nSettings\\nLogout\\n)\\nDashboard\\nChallenges\\nLeaderboard\\nHelp\\nThe Stablecoins Commerce Stack Challenge\\nStatus\\nThis challenge is open for submissions\\n2 days left\\n67 joined in the last 24h\\nChallenge Host\\n\\nArc (Circle)\\n\\nPrize\\n\\nUSD 25,000\\n\\nParticipations\\n\\n12670 Participants\\n\\nKeywords\\nCircle\\nArc\\nUSDC\\n+2\\n\\nYou're ready to compete! Submit your solution below before the deadline.\\n\\nSubmit\\nShare\\nOverview\\nRules\\nDiscussion\\nMy Submissions\\nStart\\nEnd\\nApril 14, 2026\\nAugust 10, 2026\\nStart\\nSubmissions Open\\nLive\\n\\nChallenge Overview\\n\\nThe Stablecoin Commerce Stack Challenge is a 3-month virtual program led by Ignyte, with Circle and Arc as technical sponsors, bringing together developers to explore how stablecoins can address key regional opportunities across:\\n\\nCross-border payments and remittances\\nSME finance and trade workflows\\nTokenized assets and compliant DeFi\\nThe agentic economy\\n\\nFor educational and testnet demo purposes only\\n\\nWhy Build on Arc?\\n\\nArc is a purpose-built L1 blockchain from Circle, designed to support programmable, stablecoin-based applications. It provides the foundation for developers to build and test financial systems with predictable costs, real-time settlement, and programmable logic.\\n\\nWith Arc, developers can:\\n\\nSettle transactions in USDC with predictable, dollar-denominated fees\\nAchieve deterministic finality for real-time financial workflows\\nBuild programmable payment flows using smart contracts\\nSupport cross-chain USDC movement with Circle infrastructure\\nDesign systems for payments, distribution, and financial workflows\\n\\nCore resources:\\n\\nArc docs\\nCircle docs\\nArc sample apps\\nTracks\\n1) Best Cross-Border Payments & Remittances Experience (UAE → Global)\\n\\nPrize:\\n\\n1st Place - 5000 USDC\\n2nd Place - 3000 USDC\\n\\nGoal: Build instant, low-cost cross-border payment and remittance flows using Circle’s regulated stablecoins—optimized for UAE’s high-expat corridor needs (consumer remittances, B2B settlement, global payroll, freelancer payouts).\\n\\nWhat to build (examples):\\n\\nRemittance app with transparent fees + real-time settlement confirmation\\nMarketplace settlement (UAE-based platform paying global sellers/creators)\\nGlobal payroll / contractor payouts with stablecoin settlement and receipts\\n“Pay-in AED, settle in USDC” merchant settlement prototype (conceptual UX + rails)\\n\\nRecommended Circle tools on Arc:\\n\\nUSDC (primary stablecoin rail)\\nCCTP with Bridge Kit (cross-chain USDC transfers where relevant)\\nCircle Wallets (embedded wallet UX for non-crypto-native users)\\nCircle Gateway (routing, treasury movement, settlement workflows)\\n\\nGated / advanced tools:\\n\\nStableFX - for FX-aware settlement concepts / multi-currency routing\\n2) Best SME Trade Finance & Working Capital Workflow (Invoices, Escrow, Settlement)\\n\\nPrize:\\n\\n1st Place - 5000 USDC\\n2nd Place - 3000 USDC\\n\\nGoal: Build working-capital and trade-finance solutions that reduce friction for SMEs (Small and Medium-Sized Enterprises)—using stablecoin escrow, tokenized receivables, automated settlement, and verifiable payment histories.\\n\\nWhat to build (examples):\\n\\nInvoice factoring / receivables financing prototype with automated repayment waterfalls\\nStablecoin escrow for import/export settlement (milestone-based release)\\nPurchase-order financing workflow with proof-of-delivery triggers\\nSME “credit passport” using verifiable transaction history + repayment behavior\\n\\nRecommended Circle tools on Arc:\\n\\nUSDC (settlement + escrow)\\nCCTP with Bridge Kit (cross-chain USDC transfers where relevant)\\nCircle Wallets (embedded wallet UX for non-crypto-native users)\\nCircle Gateway (treasury routing, multi-party flows, operational movement)\\n\\nGated / advanced tools:\\n\\nUSYC - yield-bearing cash management concepts for idle treasury/inventory float\\n3) Best Real World Asset Tokenization on Arc with Embedded Compliance\\n\\nPrize:\\n\\n1st Place - 3000 USDC\\n\\nGoal:\\nBuild infrastructure and applications for tokenizing real-world assets with embedded compliance, regulatory transparency, and institutional-grade controls on Arc.\\n\\nThis track focuses on how stablecoins and smart contracts can power the next generation of regulated digital assets in the UAE and broader GCC, where tokenization, fixed income innovation, and compliant capital markets infrastructure are rapidly evolving.\\n\\nChallenge Rules\\n\\nWhat to Build (Examples):\\n\\nFixed Income: Fractional bonds, treasury instruments, automated yield distribution, compliant secondary trading\\nSukuk & Structured Products: Fractional sukuk platforms, programmable profit distribution, embedded compliance logic\\nReal Estate & Alternatives: Tokenized property, REIT-style rent flows, commodities or carbon assets\\nCompliance Infrastructure: Onchain transfer restrictions, KYC/AML-aware logic, investor accreditation checks, audit dashboards\\n\\nRecommended Circle tools on Arc:\\n\\nUSDC compliant settlement and distributions\\nCircle Wallets investor and issuer interaction layer\\nCircle Gateway treasury and payout orchestration\\n\\nEnterprise / Gated Tools (request access):\\n\\nUSYC (Enterprise only)\\nStableFX (Enterprise only)\\n4) Best Agentic Economy Experience on Arc\\n\\nPrize:\\n\\n1st Place - 4000 USDC\\n2nd Place - 2000 USDC\\n\\nGoal:\\nBuild autonomous economic experiences where AI agents can research, negotiate, and execute transactions on behalf of users or businesses using onchain rails and programmable payment logic.\\n\\nWhat to build (examples):\\n\\nAn AI agent that autonomously executes a stablecoin-settled purchase using Arc smart contracts\\nAutomated subscription purchase workflows where agents manage renewal, budgeting, and payment authorization\\nAutonomous merchant settlement systems where AI negotiates and settles with multiple onchain counterparties\\nAI-driven loyalty programs that reason about cost, rewards, and payment routing across wallet\"}"